<title>UK: C.E.Heath agrees to 96.1 mln stg MBO.</title>
<headline>C.E.Heath agrees to 96.1 mln stg MBO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK-based insurance and financial services company C.E. Heath Plc said on Friday it had agreed to a 96.1 million pound management buyout backed by DLJ Phoenix Private Equity.</p>
<p>The offer values each C.E. Heath share at 143p in cash and represents a premium of 63 percent to the price of C.E. Heath's shares on May 29.</p>
</text>
